msgid "Consider the countries of the people your site is aimed at or whose behavior it monitors (for example through profiling or behavioral advertising), not every country from which it can be visited. If in doubt, select the country: the card of each regulation, below, explains when it applies, and only the regulations you confirm are added to your policies."
